    ;; (1 send returned, 2 the body was written, 4 its trailers, 8 the
    ;; result was given, 16 a response body read in flight, 32 the response
    ;; body ended, 64 a body write in flight, 128 a trailers write in
    ;; flight, 256 a done write in flight), 4 the request record whose set
    ;; its waitables join, 8 the subtask, 12 the body stream's writable
    ;; end, 16 the trailers future's, 20 the body {20 bytes, 24 length, 28
    ;; how far}, 40 the response, 44 the task waiting for it, 48 send's
    ;; result (32 bytes), 80 the trailers' ok(none) (16), 96 the response
    ;; body stream, 100 its bytes {100, 104 length, 108 capacity}, 112 its
    ;; done future's writable end, 116 0, 1 reading the response body, 2
    ;; it ended, 128 the done value (32).

