    (func $wasi_http_send (param $mk i64) (param $m i32) (param $mn i32) (param $sk i64) (param $au i32) (param $aun i32) (param $pq i32) (param $pqn i32) (param $h i32) (param $hn i32) (param $b i32) (param $bn i32) (param $tns i64) (result i64) (local $C i32) (local $f i32) (local $s i64) (local $t i64) (local $opt i32) (local $q i32) (local $v i32) (local $bad i32) (local $st i32) (local $R i32)
